<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" href="/fonts/e4af272ccee01ff0-s.p.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="anonymous" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="preload" href="/fonts/bb3ef058b751a6ad-s.p.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="anonymous" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="preload" as="image" imageSrcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fvision-xix-logo.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fvision-xix-logo.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 2x"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/532cba65621fdb11.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/fd496917896bbbdc.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-69f14800859f0b85.js"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-9ce25231cbb0ecf2.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/93794-7c5eb5b4643d7857.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/main-app-b553342bc0a9b6f5.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/98500-202fb27570ee6051.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/37882-b9dc7f2fb9b2a293.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/93197-59c54cbbe39d027f.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-61075ac6ab106ee6.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/38437-ab43c492a711661a.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/42191-801106830bf87512.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/security/page-31dc7ff38aa4f800.js" async=""></script><meta name="theme-color" content="#141414"/><title>Security and governance | Vision XIX Labs</title><meta name="description" content="Understand Axiom&#x27;s access, review, credential and outcome boundaries, with explicit verification limits."/><link rel="author" href="https://visionxixlabs.com"/><meta name="author" content="Vision XIX Labs LLC"/><link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest"/><meta name="keywords" content="autonomous cloud operations,cloud operations agent,infrastructure intelligence,cloud cost optimization,drift detection,cloud governance,Terraform automation,AWS operations,cloud security scanning,Vision XIX Labs,Axiom,infrastructure as code,approval workflows,cloud audit trail,multi-cloud,Azure scanning,GCP scanning,AI cloud operations,cloud compliance,rollback automation,scheduled cloud scans"/><meta name="creator" content="Vision XIX Labs"/><meta name="publisher" content="Vision XIX Labs LLC"/><meta name="robots" content="index, follow"/><meta name="googlebot" content="index, follow"/><meta name="category" content="technology"/><link rel="canonical" href="https://visionxixlabs.com/security"/><meta property="og:title" content="Axiom Agent | Governed cloud operations"/><meta property="og:description" content="A downloadable application for deployment intake, approvals, guided execution, validation evidence, audit history, and reusable runbooks."/><meta property="og:url" content="https://visionxixlabs.com"/><meta property="og:site_name" content="Vision XIX Labs"/><meta property="og:locale" content="en_US"/><meta property="og:image" content="https://visionxixlabs.com/vision-xix-logo.png"/><meta property="og:image:width" content="512"/><meta property="og:image:height" content="512"/><meta property="og:image:alt" content="Vision XIX Labs"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="Axiom Agent | Governed cloud operations"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Download Axiom Agent for deployment intake, approvals, guided execution, evidence, audit history, and reusable runbooks."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://visionxixlabs.com/vision-xix-logo.png"/><meta name="twitter:image:alt" content="Vision XIX Labs"/><meta name="twitter:image:width" content="512"/><meta name="twitter:image:height" content="512"/><link rel="shortcut icon" href="/axiom-favicon-1b77e225c532.png"/><link rel="icon" href="/axiom-favicon-1b77e225c532.png" sizes="32x32" type="image/png"/><link rel="icon" href="/axiom-icon-cedd8eb1034f.png" sizes="512x512" type="image/png"/><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/axiom-apple-icon-497d44ea000e.png"/><link rel="preload" href="/fonts/e4af272ccee01ff0-s.p.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous"/><link rel="preload" href="/fonts/bb3ef058b751a6ad-s.p.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js" noModule=""></script></head><body class="axiom-font-inter axiom-font-mono antialiased"><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"Vision XIX Labs","legalName":"Vision XIX Labs LLC","url":"https://visionxixlabs.com","logo":"https://visionxixlabs.com/vision-xix-logo.png","description":"Axiom is an autonomous cloud operations agent. It scans infrastructure, reasons about what to fix, generates execution plans, and applies approved changes — with governance, rollback, and full audit trail.","foundingDate":"2024","sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/company/vision-xix-labs/","https://x.com/VisionXIXLabs","https://github.com/sahme209/axiom-releases"]}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebSite","name":"Vision XIX Labs","url":"https://visionxixlabs.com","description":"Axiom is an autonomous cloud operations agent. It scans infrastructure, reasons about what to fix, generates execution plans, and applies approved changes — with governance, rollback, and full audit trail.","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Vision XIX Labs","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://visionxixlabs.com/vision-xix-logo.png"}}}</script><p role="status" aria-live="polite" class="sr-only"></p><div class="scroll-progress-bar" aria-hidden="true"></div><div><div class="axiom-canvas min-h-screen text-zinc-100"><nav aria-label="Primary navigation" class="site-navigation fixed inset-x-0 top-0 z-50 transition-[background-color,border-color] duration-300 border-b border-transparent bg-[#090a08]/62"><div class="mx-auto flex backdrop-blur-xl max-w-[1280px] items-center justify-between px-5 transition-[height] duration-300 sm:px-8 lg:px-10 h-16 xl:h-[72px]"><button type="button" class="sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:absolute focus:left-5 focus:top-3 focus:z-10 focus:rounded-lg focus:bg-white focus:px-4 focus:py-3 focus:text-sm focus:font-semibold focus:text-black focus:outline focus:outline-2 focus:outline-offset-2 focus:outline-orange-300">Skip to content</button><a class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-zinc-100" aria-label="Vision XIX Labs home" href="/"><img alt="" width="28" height="28" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fvision-xix-logo.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fvision-xix-logo.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fvision-xix-logo.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75"/><span>Vision XIX Labs</span></a><div class="hidden items-center gap-7 xl:flex"><a class="text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/product">Product</a><a class="text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/integrations">Integrations</a><a class="text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/security">Security</a><a class="text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/docs">Docs</a><a class="text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/demo">Demo</a><div class="relative"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="more-navigation" class="flex items-center gap-1 py-2 text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white">More <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-[10px]">⌄</span></button></div></div><div class="hidden items-center gap-3 xl:flex"><a class="px-2 py-2 text-sm text-zinc-300 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/auth/signin">Sign in</a><a class="rounded-lg bg-[#f0f0eb] px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[#11120f] transition hover:bg-white" href="/download">Download</a></div><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobile-navigation" aria-label="Open navigation menu" class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-zinc-300 hover:bg-white/[0.06] xl:hidden"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-6 w-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 6.75h16.5M3.75 12h16.5m-16.5 5.25h16.5"></path></svg></button></div></nav><main class="mx-auto max-w-[1280px] space-y-14 px-5 pb-20 pt-28 sm:px-8 lg:px-10 lg:pt-36"><header class="max-w-3xl space-y-5"><p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-zinc-500">Axiom · Security</p><h1 class="text-[clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.5rem)] font-medium leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.05em]">Know the boundary.<br/><span class="text-zinc-500">Verify the workflow.</span></h1><p class="text-base leading-7 text-zinc-400 sm:text-lg">Understand the access, decision and evidence behind an action. Assess the exact workflow and version instead of relying on a badge or a broad promise.</p><p class="text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-500">This page describes source-level controls and known limits. It is not a completed security assessment or proof that every deployment path is qualified.</p></header><section aria-labelledby="action-assessment"><h2 id="action-assessment" class="text-xl font-medium tracking-tight">How to assess an action</h2><ol aria-label="How to assess an action" class="mt-5 grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-5"><li class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.025] p-5"><p class="text-xs tabular-nums text-zinc-500">01</p><h3 class="mt-4 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-100">Current access</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400">Check the actor, workspace, provider connection and exact target. A connected label is not permission for every action.</p></li><li class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.025] p-5"><p class="text-xs tabular-nums text-zinc-500">02</p><h3 class="mt-4 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-100">Exact proposal</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400">Inspect what would change, its source and scope, and the proposed validation and recovery steps.</p></li><li class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.025] p-5"><p class="text-xs tabular-nums text-zinc-500">03</p><h3 class="mt-4 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-100">Independent review</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400">Check which review the selected workflow requires, who may decide and whether the exact decision is still valid.</p></li><li class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.025] p-5"><p class="text-xs tabular-nums text-zinc-500">04</p><h3 class="mt-4 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-100">Deliberate execution</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400">Confirm the requester and current authority again. A saved plan or approval alone is not a provider outcome.</p></li><li class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.025] p-5"><p class="text-xs tabular-nums text-zinc-500">05</p><h3 class="mt-4 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-100">Outcome and recovery</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400">Distinguish confirmed, refused and unknown results. Inspect history before recovery; do not resend an uncertain action.</p></li></ol></section><section aria-labelledby="control-areas"><div class="max-w-2xl"><h2 id="control-areas" class="text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight">Inspect a specific control.</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400">Implementation notes are not independent assurance. Follow the relevant guide, then verify the configured operation.</p></div><div class="mt-6 grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-2"><article class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 p-6"><h3 class="text-base font-medium">Identity and current permissions</h3><p class="mb-4 mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400">The desktop uses a browser handoff and scoped session. Role and action checks belong in the service; interface visibility does not grant authority.</p><a class="mt-auto inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-sm text-zinc-200 underline-offset-4 hover:underline focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-orange-300" href="/docs/permissions-model">Read the permissions model<!-- --> →</a></article><article class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 p-6"><h3 class="text-base font-medium">Credentials and stored content</h3><p class="mb-4 mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400">Credential custody differs by connector. Native session-vault and server redaction code exist, but packaged persistence, provider scopes, revocation and recovery need their own verification.</p><a class="mt-auto inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-sm text-zinc-200 underline-offset-4 hover:underline focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-orange-300" href="/docs/security-model">Read the security model<!-- --> →</a></article><article class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 p-6"><h3 class="text-base font-medium">Review and execution boundaries</h3><p class="mb-4 mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400">Exact review, requester execution and platform checks depend on the operation and installed version. Full Governance Intelligence coverage and activation are not complete.</p><a class="mt-auto inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-sm text-zinc-200 underline-offset-4 hover:underline focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-orange-300" href="/docs/approval-workflow">Understand the approval workflow<!-- --> →</a></article><article class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 p-6"><h3 class="text-base font-medium">Recorded outcomes and audit context</h3><p class="mb-4 mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400">Supported paths record actors, decisions and outcomes. A saved record, green workflow or rollback instruction does not by itself prove application health or successful recovery.</p><a class="mt-auto inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-sm text-zinc-200 underline-offset-4 hover:underline focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-orange-300" href="/docs/audit-logs">Understand recorded activity<!-- --> →</a></article></div></section><section aria-labelledby="ai-data-boundary" class="border-t border-white/10 pt-7"><h2 id="ai-data-boundary" class="text-xl font-medium">Data and AI boundaries</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-400">Before sharing context with an AI provider, verify the selected provider, data sent and applicable policy. This page makes no guarantee about provider retention or model training, and does not establish an offline or no-egress deployment. Local-AI and enterprise offline work remain separate acceptance requirements.</p><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-400">Redaction utilities on selected paths are not proof that arbitrary input is free of secrets. Do not include credentials or sensitive execution data in a support request.</p><figure aria-label="Axiom Bot prompt and response flow" class="mt-7 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.12] bg-white/[0.02]"><figcaption class="border-b border-white/10 px-5 py-5 sm:px-6"><p class="text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-orange-300/90">One specific path · Axiom Bot AI response</p><h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-zinc-100">Know what crosses each boundary.</h3><p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-xs leading-6 text-zinc-400">Source-inspected illustration of the local preview, not a recording or connection inspection. Availability depends on the installed version and enabled service.</p></figcaption><ol aria-label="Bot response stages" class="grid gap-3 p-4 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:p-5 xl:grid-cols-4"><li class="min-w-0 rounded-xl border p-4 border-white/[0.08] bg-black/10"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-zinc-500">01</span><p class="max-w-[180px] text-right text-[10px] leading-4 text-zinc-400">Desktop editor</p></div><h4 class="mt-5 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-100">Unsent local draft</h4><p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-6 text-zinc-400">Typing edits the draft in the app. Saving to the workspace and requesting an AI response are separate, explicit choices.</p></li><li class="min-w-0 rounded-xl border p-4 border-white/[0.08] bg-black/10"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-zinc-500">02</span><p class="max-w-[180px] text-right text-[10px] leading-4 text-zinc-400">Workspace service</p></div><h4 class="mt-5 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-100">Saved workspace draft</h4><p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-6 text-zinc-400">Save uploads the draft. Send first saves new or changed text, then verifies the exact saved version before requesting a response.</p></li><li class="min-w-0 rounded-xl border p-4 border-orange-300/20 bg-orange-300/[0.025]"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-zinc-500">03</span><p class="max-w-[180px] text-right text-[10px] leading-4 text-zinc-400">Configured gateway → selected model</p></div><h4 class="mt-5 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-100">Explicit AI request</h4><p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-6 text-zinc-400">This Bot path prepares title, instruction and context for the selected model, plus recorded GitHub evidence only when you explicitly select it. Current model, access and budget checks still apply.</p></li><li class="min-w-0 rounded-xl border p-4 border-white/[0.08] bg-black/10"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-zinc-500">04</span><p class="max-w-[180px] text-right text-[10px] leading-4 text-zinc-400">Saved task activity</p></div><h4 class="mt-5 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-100">Recorded outcome</h4><p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-6 text-zinc-400">Read the saved answer or request for more information, or inspect a pending/stopped state. If the outcome is unconfirmed, check that same request; do not resend.</p></li></ol><div role="group" aria-label="Separate reviewed app-action workflow" class="mx-4 mb-5 border-t border-dashed border-white/15 pt-5 sm:mx-5"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-zinc-200">Separate lane · reviewed app actions</p><p class="mt-2 max-w-4xl text-xs leading-6 text-zinc-400">Task-linked Slack, Teams and Linear changes use a separate exact plan, a different authorized human&#x27;s decision and the requester&#x27;s deliberate execution. Opening App actions is not execution. This AI response does not call app tools.</p></div><details class="border-t border-white/10 px-5 py-4 text-xs text-zinc-400 sm:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer py-1 text-zinc-300 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-orange-300">What the prompt includes — and what this figure leaves out</summary><div class="mt-3 max-w-4xl space-y-3 leading-6"><p>The prompt supplies fixed instructions and a response-format schema alongside JSON task data. Selected recorded evidence adds its observed time, release ID/version, repository, pull request number and recorded pull request fields. It is evidence-only data and may no longer reflect the provider.</p><p>This is not a complete egress inventory: request, metering and receipt metadata have their own transport and storage paths. The figure does not establish provider retention, model-training terms, automatic secret removal or an offline deployment. Review the actual context, provider and applicable policy before Send; never include credentials.</p></div></details></figure></section><section aria-labelledby="current-security-limits" class="rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/[0.025] p-6"><h2 id="current-security-limits" class="text-xl font-medium">Current limits</h2><ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-400"><li class="flex gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true">—</span><span>Signing, installation, saved sessions and update trust are release- and platform-specific. Check the actual download and installation facts.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true">—</span><span>AWS validation needs the configured broker and customer IAM setup; inventory/security analysis remains preview-grade. Azure and GCP provider-specific live paths have their own unfinished verification.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true">—</span><span>Local Terraform apply remains disabled. A generated artifact is for review, not evidence that a change ran.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true">—</span><span>Tenant isolation, retention, backup/restore, incident response and every relevant permission path need deployment-specific security assessment.</span></li></ul><p class="mt-5 border-t border-white/10 pt-5 text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-400">No independent certification is claimed. Product design principles are not SOC 2, ISO 27001, HIPAA, CMMC or FedRAMP assurance, a customer risk assessment, or a guarantee against vulnerabilities. Required agreements, vendor review and independent evidence remain deployment-specific.</p></section><section class="flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-5 border-t border-white/10 pt-7 sm:flex-row"><div><h2 class="text-xl font-medium">Need a boundary explained?</h2><p class="mt-2 max-w-xl text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400">Read the security guide or use the published contact route. Share the affected surface and version without sending secrets.</p></div><a class="inline-flex min-h-11 shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-white/20 px-4 text-sm focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-orange-300" href="/contact">Contact the team →</a></section></main><footer class="site-footer border-t border-white/[0.07] bg-[#090a08] px-5 pb-8 sm:px-8 lg:px-10"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1280px]"><section class="flex flex-col gap-8 border-b border-white/[0.07] py-12 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between lg:py-16" aria-labelledby="footer-cta-heading"><div><p class="text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-zinc-400">Axiom Agent</p><h2 id="footer-cta-heading" class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-3xl font-medium leading-tight tracking-[-0.045em] text-zinc-100 sm:text-5xl">Engineering intent, under control.</h2></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="rounded-lg bg-zinc-100 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-950 hover:bg-white" href="/product">Explore Axiom</a><a class="rounded-lg border border-orange-300/30 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-orange-200 transition hover:border-orange-300/60 hover:bg-orange-300/[0.06]" href="/support">Founding Supporters</a></div></section><div class="grid gap-12 py-16 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-[2fr_repeat(3,1fr)] lg:gap-10"><div><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-100" href="/"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fvision-xix-logo.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fvision-xix-logo.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fvision-xix-logo.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75"/>Vision XIX Labs</a><p class="mt-5 max-w-sm text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400">Axiom Agent brings AI assistance, human authorization, execution, and evidence into one governed engineering workflow.</p><p class="mt-2 max-w-sm text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400">We also build iOS applications.</p></div><div><h3 class="text-xs text-zinc-400">Product</h3><ul class="mt-5 space-y-3"><li><a class="text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/product">Product</a></li><li><a class="text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/demo">Demo</a></li><li><a class="text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/docs">Docs</a></li><li><a class="text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/download">Download</a></li><li><a class="text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/integrations">Integrations</a></li><li><a class="text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/plans">Pricing</a></li><li><a class="text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/security">Security</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class="text-xs text-zinc-400">Company</h3><ul class="mt-5 space-y-3"><li><a class="text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/axiom">About</a></li><li><a class="text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/support">Founding Supporters</a></li><li><a class="text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/account/help">Support (account required)</a></li><li><a class="text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/contact">Contact</a></li><li><a class="text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/status">Service status</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class="text-xs text-zinc-400">Legal</h3><ul class="mt-5 space-y-3"><li><a class="text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/privacy">Privacy</a></li><li><a class="text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/terms">Terms</a></li><li><a class="text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/security">Security</a></li></ul></div></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 border-t border-w