 The figure does not establish provider retention, model-training terms, automatic secret removal or an offline deployment. Review the actual context, provider and applicable policy before Send; never include credentials.\"}]]}]]}]\n3b:[\"$\",\"div\",\"Legal\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-zinc-400\",\"children\":\"Legal\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"/privacy\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L23\",null,{\"href\":\"/privacy\",\"className\":\"text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white\",\"children\":\"Privacy\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"/terms\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L23\",null,{\"href\":\"/terms\",\"className\":\"text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white\",\"children\":\"Terms\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"/security\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L23\",null,{\"href\":\"/security\",\"className\":\"text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white\",\"children\":\"Security\"}]}]]}]]}]\n3c:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 border-t border-white/[0.07] pt-7 text-xs text-zinc-400 sm:flex-row sm:justify-between\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"© \",2026,\" Vision XIX Labs. All rights reserved.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Production access is service-verified. Demonstrations are clearly labeled.\"}]]}]\n31:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"2\",{\"name\":\"theme-color\",\"content\":\"#141414\"}]]\n3f:I[86869,[],\"IconMark\"]\n35:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Security and governance | Vision XIX Labs\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Understand Axiom's access, review, credential and outcome boundaries, with explicit verification limits.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"author\",\"href\":\"https://visionxixlabs.com\"}],[\"$